<ROUTINE I-LEDGE ("AUX" (RM ,LEDGE-2)) <COND (<EQUAL? ,HERE ,LEDGE-2> <COND (<IN? ,WINNER ,BALLOON> <COND (,BTIE-FLAG <SETG BLOC ,VOLCANO-BOTTOM> <REMOVE ,BALLOON> <MOVE ,DEAD-BALLOON ,VOLCANO-BOTTOM> <SETG BTIE-FLAG <>> <SETG BINF-FLAG <>> <PUT <INT I-BALLOON> 0 0> <PUT <INT I-BURNUP> 0 0> <JIGS-UP "The ledge collapses, probably as a result of the explosion, and plummets
